---
import PageShell from "../components/PageShell.astro";
---

<PageShell title="About | The 100 Hackathoner">
  <section class="page-hero container">
    <h1>Learning in public, one hackathon at a time.</h1>
    <p>
      Sayyid Khan is a Singapore-based AI builder documenting the road to 100
      hackathons while moving from builder mindset toward founder/operator
      judgement.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section rail">
    <div class="container split">
      <h2 class="serif">Why this exists</h2>
      <div>
        <p>
          Most portfolios show outcomes. This site keeps the whole record: the
          idea, the people, the chaos, the build, the failure, the win, and the
          lesson.
        </p>
        <p>
          Hackathons compress ambition into a deadline. They reveal whether a
          problem matters, whether the prototype works, whether the story lands,
          and whether the builder is becoming sharper.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container beliefs">
    <h2 class="serif">Operating Beliefs</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Building is a form of self-discovery.</li>
      <li>Repetition creates luck.</li>
      <li>Shipping reveals truth.</li>
      <li>Failure compounds into instinct.</li>
      <li>Purpose is discovered through motion.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section contact-section" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
    <div class="container contact">
      <div>
        <p class="contact-eyebrow">Get in touch</p>
        <h2 id="contact-heading">Invite me into the room where builders gather.</h2>
        <p class="contact-intro">
          Speaking, mentoring, judging, AI workshops, hackathon programming, and
          collaborations around fast prototyping, AI agents, and builder culture.
        </p>
      </div>
      <form action="mailto:hello@example.com" method="post" enctype="text/plain">
        <label>
          Name
          <input name="name" autocomplete="name" />
        </label>
        <label>
          Email
          <input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" />
        </label>
        <label>
          What are you planning?
          <textarea name="message" rows="6"></textarea>
        </label>
        <button class="button primary" type="submit">Start the Conversation</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageShell>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: 86px 0 92px;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 8vw, 8rem);
    font-weight: 950;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    line-height: 0.96;
  }

  .page-hero p {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 28px 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.16rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.7fr) minmax(300px, 0.85fr);
    gap: 48px;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 5.6rem);
    line-height: 0.92;
  }

  p {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .beliefs ul {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 32px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  li {
    min-height: 150px;
    border-top: 5px solid var(--red);
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    padding: 18px;
  }

  li:nth-child(2) {
    border-color: var(--blue);
  }

  li:nth-child(3) {
    border-color: var(--teal);
  }

  li:nth-child(4) {
    border-color: var(--yellow);
  }

  li:nth-child(5) {
    border-color: var(--black);
  }

  .contact-section {
    scroll-margin-top: 120px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--bg-paper);
  }

  .contact {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(320px, 0.65fr);
    gap: 54px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .contact-eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    color: var(--red);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .contact h2 {
    max-width: 760px;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-weight: 950;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    line-height: 0.96;
  }

  .contact-intro {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 28px 0 0;
    font-size: 1.12rem;
  }

  form {
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    padding: 24px;
  }

  label {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  input,
  textarea {
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 0;
    background: var(--bg-paper);
    color: var(--text);
    padding: 13px 12px;
  }

  textarea {
    resize: vertical;
  }

  form button {
    width: 100%;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .split,
    .beliefs ul,
    .contact {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
